=== SUMMARY ===
THM-076 proves |hat{H}[S]| = 2^r * (n-2k)! / 2^{n-1}
Constraint: monomial S needs 2k+r <= n vertices, so |S| = 2k <= n-1
Only even weights survive → max weight = 2*floor((n-1)/2)
This proves band-limitedness for ALL n since 2*floor((n-1)/2) <= n-1 << C(n-1,2)/2
